  "body": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-tw-spelling-guidelines-of-tangliengim/\">繁體中文</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-bright-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-cn-spelling-guidelines-of-tangliengim/\">简体中文</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/learn/introduction/\">Tangliengim</a> takes Taipei Hokkien as its principal reference point, but does not represent Taipei pronunciation exclusively. Some spellings reflect broader regional correspondences or the internal design of the orthography.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">This page sets out these spelling conventions, along with special spellings and rules for transcribing foreign words.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Regional spelling correspondences</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"3-the-ue-e-alternation-ㅚ-vs-ㅞ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅚ and ㅞ: /ue/ ~ /e/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Spelling</th><th>Hanri list</th><th>Standard</th><th>Amoy • Taipei</th><th>Kaohsiung</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅚ <em>oe</em></td><td>雞, 八, 𣍐</td><td><strong><ruby>괴<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, 뵣, <ruby>뾔<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em>(=Standard)</em></td><td><ruby>게<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, 벻, <ruby><ruby>뻬<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>ㅞ <em>ue</em></td><td>粿, 月, 未</td><td><strong><ruby>궤<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>뀋<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>쀄<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><ruby>게<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>껳<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby><ruby>뻬<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><em>(=Standard)</em></td></tr><tr><td>ㅞ <em>ue</em></td><td>瓜, 話, 花</td><td><strong><ruby>궤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>웨<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>훼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em>(=Standard)</em></td><td><em>(=Standard)</em></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"4-the-i-ɨ-u-alternation-ㅜ-vs-ㅢ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅜ and ㅢ: /i/ ~ /ɨ/ ~ /u/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Spelling</th><th>Hanri list</th><th>Standard</th><th>Taipei</th><th>Quanzhou</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅜ <em>u</em></td><td>女, 私, 煮</td><td><strong><ruby>루<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>수<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>주<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em>(=Standard)</em></td><td><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>스<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>즈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>ㅢ <em>i</em></td><td>你, 去, 魚</td><td><strong><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, 킈, <ruby>희<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><ruby>루<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, 쿠, <ruby><ruby>후<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>, 크, <ruby><ruby>흐<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅜ/ㅢ + ㄴ: /un/ ~ /in/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Spelling</th><th>Hanri list</th><th>Standard</th><th>Amoy • Taipei</th><th>Kaohsiung</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅜ + ㄴ <em>un</em></td><td>斤, 跟, 銀</td><td><strong><ruby>군<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>군<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>꾼<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em><em>(</em>=S<em>tandard)</em></em></td><td><ruby>긘<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>긘<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby><ruby>끤<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"5-nasal-initials-and-nasal-final-ㄹ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Nasal finals after nasal initials</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">After ㄴ, ㅁ, or ㆆ, an underlying nasal final ㄹ is not written again.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Consonants</th><th>Hanri list</th><th>Taipei</th><th>Kaohsiung</th><th>Non-standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㄴ, ㅁ, ㆆ</td><td>呢, 暝, 硬</td><td><ruby>니<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>미<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>ᅙᅵ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby>네<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>메<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>ᅙᅦ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby>닐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>밀<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>ᅙᅦᆯ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>All other jamo</td><td>衫, 星</td><td><ruby>살<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>칠<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby>살<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby><ruby>첼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><em>N/A</em></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"6-spelling-exceptions\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Special spellings</h2>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"7-vowel-change-before-ㄹ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Transcription of foreign words</h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"i-transcription-of-ə-ㅓ-ㄹ-ə\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">i. Transcription of /ə/ (ㅡ + ㅔ → /ə/)</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phoneme <strong>/ə/</strong> is written as <strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif\">ᅟힻ</span></strong></strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Example</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby><ruby>ᄉힻ<rp>(ꞈ)</rp></ruby><rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /sə/ (English &#8216;sir&#8217;)<br></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">/uə/ and /iə/ are transcibed as 우ᄋힻ and 이ᄋힻ respectively.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"ii-transcription-of-d-and-r-as-ɾ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ii. Transcription of /d/ and /r/ as /<strong>ɾ</strong>/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phonemes <strong>/d/ </strong>and<strong> /r/</strong> are realised as <strong>/ɾ/</strong> in speech and written as <strong>ㄸ</strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Example</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><ruby>떼<rt>ˍ</rt><ruby>뚀<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /ɾe.ɾio/ (English <em>radio</em>)</ruby></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"iv-transcription-of-z\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">iii. Transcription of /z/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phoneme <strong>/z/</strong> is written as <strong>ㅉ</strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Example</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby>찝<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /zip/ (English <em>zip</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"iii-transcription-of-dʒ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">iv. Transcription of /dʒ/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phoneme <strong>/dʒ/</strong> is written as <strong>ㅉ</strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Example</strong>:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby>찜<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /dʒim/ (English <em>gym</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"v-transcription-of-v\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">v. Transcription of /v/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phoneme <strong>/v/</strong> is written as <strong>쁘</strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong><strong>Example</strong>:</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>쁘<ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>뚀<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /bi.rio/ (English <em>video</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><ruby>래<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>쁘 /laɪb/ (English <em>live</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"vi-transcription-of-f\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">vi. Transcription of /f/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Foreign phoneme <strong>/f/</strong> is written as <strong>흐</strong>.<br></li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong><strong>Example</strong>:</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>흐<ruby>띠<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> /hri/ (English <em>free</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>흐<ruby>에<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>스 /hes/ (English <em>face</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
}
